WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.000
What Diamond Project is — Prof. BB, July 2026.

00:08.000 --> 00:20.000
Diamond Project is a network marketing business:
you earn by selling products and by building
a team that sells products.

00:20.000 --> 00:32.000
There is no salary and no shortcut —
income follows value created.

00:32.000 --> 00:48.000
Your first job: understand the compensation plan
at a level where you could explain it
on a whiteboard in five minutes.

00:48.000 --> 01:00.000
Income follows value, not tenure.
Learn the plan cold before recruiting.
